          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/llm-subagent-connectivity",
          "ruleIndex": 0,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "LLM subagent connectivity — No issue identified: sandbox agent pipeline\n\nChild agent executed `node --version` (v24.18.0) and `date -u` (Wed Oct 14 21:21:22 UTC 2026) successfully via exec_command, then recorded coverage and finished — trivial subagent LLM pipeline round-trip works."
